# 13. INFRASTRUCTURE AUDIT INTELLIGENCE

This is a major feature of the application.

The system must assist professional auditors, including public-sector performance and compliance auditors.

The application should support road infrastructure audits in Bhutan, including the type of analysis that may be relevant to the Royal Audit Authority and other authorized auditing institutions.

